DayName←{
   ⍝ Day-of-week name from Julian day number ⍵
   ⍝ Converts to calendar date via JnuInv, then uses Sakamoto's algorithm
    m d y←JnuInv ⍵
    y←y-m<3
    t←0 3 2 5 0 3 5 1 4 6 2 4
    w←7|(⌊y÷400)+(⌊y÷4)+y+t[m]+d-⌊y÷100
    (1+w)⊃'SUNDAY' 'MONDAY' 'TUESDAY' 'WEDNESDAY' 'THURSDAY' 'FRIDAY' 'SATURDAY' }
